= Key Findings
An analysis of the preliminary enrollment data reveals a concentrated yet diverse cohort of educators. The initiative has successfully registered 5 key participants, each representing a distinct educational institution. This cross-institutional participation is anticipated to facilitate a rich exchange of diverse pedagogical experiences and localized educational challenges.

