= Qualitative Feedback
While the workshop is scheduled for a future date (November 2026), the qualitative assessment framework is designed to capture educator feedback regarding the applicability of AI tools in their respective curricula. Anticipated feedback will focus on the practical utility of the digital literacy modules and the effectiveness of the instructional methodologies employed during the five-day session.

= Conclusion
The "Digital Literacy & AI Integration Workshop" represents a strategic intervention in the CLEC Project's broader mission to modernize educational practices. By targeting a select group of educators across diverse institutions, the workshop is positioned to catalyze a multiplier effect, whereby trained participants disseminate acquired digital and AI competencies within their local educational ecosystems. Future impact assessments will measure longitudinal outcomes following the completion of the program.